---
---
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="grid-texture" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="inner">
    <h1>One engine.<br />Eight ways in.</h1>
    <p class="lead">
      Authkestra orchestrates passkeys, OAuth2, TOTP, device flow and more behind a
      single Rust engine — chain the strategies you need, and a flow that doesn't
      hold together simply won't compile.
    </p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn primary" href="https://play.authkestra.com">Open the playground</a>
      <a class="btn secondary" href="#quickstart">Read the quickstart</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    max-width: var(--ak-layout-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--ak-space-24) var(--ak-space-6) var(--ak-space-16);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .grid-texture {
    position: absolute;
    inset: -10% -10% auto -10%;
    height: 480px;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(hsl(var(--border) / 0.5) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, hsl(var(--border) / 0.5) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 48px 48px;
    -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 55% at 50% 0%, black 40%, transparent 75%);
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 60% 55% at 50% 0%, black 40%, transparent 75%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .inner {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: var(--ak-text-4xl);
    max-width: 20ch;
  }

  .lead {
    margin-top: var(--ak-space-6);
    font-size: var(--ak-text-lg);
    color: hsl(var(--muted-foreground));
    max-width: 42ch;
  }

  .ctas {
    margin-top: var(--ak-space-8);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: var(--ak-space-4);
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0 var(--ak-space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    font-size: var(--ak-text-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: all var(--ak-duration-fast) var(--ak-ease-out);
  }

  /* The one primary-orange element in the hero region. */
  .btn.primary {
    background: hsl(var(--primary));
    color: hsl(var(--primary-foreground));
    box-shadow: var(--ak-shadow-accent);
  }

  .btn.primary:hover {
    filter: brightness(1.08);
  }

  .btn.secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: hsl(var(--foreground));
    border: 1px solid hsl(var(--input));
  }

  .btn.secondary:hover {
    border-color: hsl(var(--ring));
    background: hsl(var(--card));
  }

  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    h1 {
      font-size: var(--ak-text-5xl);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .hero {
      padding: var(--ak-space-16) var(--ak-space-4) var(--ak-space-8);
    }
    .grid-texture {
      height: 320px;
    }
  }
</style>
